"\n"
"A user preparing a batch transfer on the barcode screen can ask another\n"
"user to review it (*Request Review*): the batch is left unassigned and\n"
"listed in the *Batches to Review* tile of the barcode menu and with a\n"
"*Review* button on the batch.\n"
"\n"
"The reviewer opens the batch in review mode: the cards are the detailed\n"
"operations captured by the picker, and reading a product (with its lot\n"
"or package) or confirming a card marks them as reviewed, without\n"
"changing the captured quantities.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
